sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant Reporter as CrashReporter
    participant Store as Local persist
    participant BE as Reporter backend
    participant Vitals as Android vitals

    User->>App: triggers a crash (uncaught exception)
    App->>Reporter: UncaughtExceptionHandler -> capture stack + context (breadcrumbs Ch 89, state)
    Reporter->>Reporter: redact PII (Ch 28)
    Reporter->>Store: persist report (process is dying - can't upload now)
    Note over App: process dies
    User->>App: relaunches
    App->>Reporter: on launch -> upload persisted report (Ch 44)
    Reporter->>BE: report -> deobfuscate via mapping (Ch 27) + group/dedup
    BE->>Vitals: crash counted -> crash-free rate (release-over-release)
